* Behavioural op-amp and comparator models for the Monaco GP sound board
* references. Single supply (vcc, gnd). Typical data-sheet figures, stated
* per model; they are typical, not worst-case, values.
*
* Input stage: a transconductance limited by tanh to +-ISLEW into an
* integrating capacitor, so slew = ISLEW/CINT, unity-gain bandwidth =
* GM/(2 pi CINT), DC gain = GM*RINT (100 dB). A soft conductance holds the
* integrator node 0.25 V beyond the output swing, so the model leaves
* saturation without wind-up, after about 0.5 us (LM324), and its leakage
* does not move a comparator's switching point. The output follows the node
* within the swing limits through 50 ohm.
*
* LM324: 1.2 MHz unity gain, 0.5 V/us slew (TI SLOS066 typ); output 0.02 V
* to vcc-1.5 V.
.subckt LM324 inp inn out vcc gnd
.param gm=1e-3 cint={gm/(2*3.14159265*1.2e6)} islew={0.5e6*cint}
Gin gnd int value={islew*tanh(gm*(V(inp)-V(inn))/islew)}
Cint int gnd {cint}
Rint int mid 1e8
Emid mid gnd vcc gnd 0.5
Gclh int gnd value={0.05*(max(V(int)-V(vcc,gnd)+1.5-0.25,0)+0.01*ln(1+exp(-abs(V(int)-V(vcc,gnd)+1.5-0.25)/0.01)))}
Gcll gnd int value={0.05*(max(0.02-0.25-V(int),0)+0.01*ln(1+exp(-abs(0.02-0.25-V(int))/0.01)))}
Bout o1 gnd V={max(0.02,min(V(vcc,gnd)-1.5,V(int)))}
Rout o1 out 50
.ends LM324
*
* TL081 on a single supply: 3 MHz unity gain, 13 V/us slew (TI SLOS081
* typ); output 1.5 V to vcc-hid (hid 1.5 V unless an instance sets it).
.subckt TL081 inp inn out vcc gnd params: hid=1.5
.param gm=1e-3 cint={gm/(2*3.14159265*3e6)} islew={13e6*cint}
Gin gnd int value={islew*tanh(gm*(V(inp)-V(inn))/islew)}
Cint int gnd {cint}
Rint int mid 1e8
Emid mid gnd vcc gnd 0.5
Gclh int gnd value={0.05*(max(V(int)-V(vcc,gnd)+hid-0.25,0)+0.01*ln(1+exp(-abs(V(int)-V(vcc,gnd)+hid-0.25)/0.01)))}
Gcll gnd int value={0.05*(max(1.5-0.25-V(int),0)+0.01*ln(1+exp(-abs(1.5-0.25-V(int))/0.01)))}
Bout o1 gnd V={max(1.5,min(V(vcc,gnd)-hid,V(int)))}
Rout o1 out 50
.ends TL081
*
* LM339 comparator: open-collector output sinking to gnd, about 0.3 us
* response, saturation about 0.1 V at a few mA.
.subckt LM339 inp inn out gnd
Bsw ctl gnd V={0.5+0.5*tanh((V(inn)-V(inp))*2000)}
Rctl ctl c2 1k
Cctl c2 gnd 0.3n
Gsink out gnd value={V(c2)*16e-3*tanh(max(V(out),0)/0.1)}
Roff out gnd 1e9
.ends LM339
